1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:04,422
(Penny:)Look, Amy, all you need to know
is you are my friend.

2
00:00:04,628 --> 00:00:06,548
l don't wanna lose you out of my life.

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:10,095
(Amy:)I'm sorry, I'm just having trouble
believing you right now.

4
00:00:13,261 --> 00:00:15,511
- Grab your hammer.
- No, damage is done.

5
00:00:18,308 --> 00:00:20,438
Okay, look, I didn't wanna say this...

6
00:00:20,644 --> 00:00:24,064
(Penny:)...but the real reason
l took the painting down...

7
00:00:24,272 --> 00:00:27,482
(Penny:)...was because it made Bernadette
very jealous.

8
00:00:28,944 --> 00:00:30,024
(Amy:)Oh, my goodness.

9
00:00:30,237 --> 00:00:32,407
(Amy:)How could I have not seen that?

10
00:00:32,614 --> 00:00:35,574
(Amy:)The painting is a constant reminder
that of the three of us...

11
00:00:35,784 --> 00:00:38,034
(Amy:)...she is the least cool.

12
00:00:39,705 --> 00:00:42,245
Yeah, that's what it is, so...

13
00:00:42,457 --> 00:00:46,377
- You have such a good heart.
- Oh. I try.

14
00:00:46,586 --> 00:00:49,796
(Penny:)- Come on.
- Well, where are we going?

15
00:00:50,007 --> 00:00:51,547
We're gonna put this back up.

16
00:00:51,758 --> 00:00:52,888
(Penny:)What about Bernadette?

17
00:00:53,093 --> 00:01:18,033
(Amy:)Oh, screw her. She's just lucky
we let her hang out with us.

